  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vicentereig/whatsapp-cli/zipball/v1.3.3",
  "body": "## What's in v1.3.3\r\n\r\n- Fixes the `Client outdated (405)` auth failure by upgrading `whatsmeow`.\r\n- Includes the recent CLI robustness work, image sending support, flag parsing fixes, and checksum parsing cleanup.\r\n- Adds standard CI on branch pushes and pull requests so tests run outside tagged releases too.\r\n\r\n## Thanks\r\n\r\nBig thanks to @seannetlife for the auth-fix PR that got this unstuck. WhatsApp changed the locks again, and Sean showed up with the spare key like a guy who absolutely did not want to be involved but still saved everybody's night.\r\n",
  "mentions_count": 1
